#. translators: Localized date.
#: views/waf/firewall-status.php:69
msgid ""
"<i class=\"wf-fa wf-fa-lightbulb-o wf-tip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> When "
"you first install the Wordfence Web Application Firewall, it will be in "
"learning mode. This allows Wordfence to learn about your site so that we can "
"understand how to protect it and how to allow normal visitors through the "
"firewall. We recommend you let Wordfence learn for a week before you enable "
"the firewall."
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"wf-fa wf-fa-lightbulb-o wf-tip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>首次安裝 "
"Wordfence Web應用防火牆時，它將處於學習模式。 這使 Wordfence "
"可以了解您的網站，以便我們了解如何保護它，以及如何允許普通訪客通過防火牆。我們建議您在啟用防火牆之前，先讓 Wordfence 學習一周。"

#: views/dashboard/options-group-license.php:164
msgid ""
"<p>Are you sure you want to reset this site's Wordfence License? This will "
"disable Premium features and return the site to the free version of "
"Wordfence. Your settings will still be retained when reinstalling a license."
"</p><p>If autorenew is enabled for the current license, the license will "
"renew at the next expiration date. If you would like to turn renewal off or "
"assign the license to another site, log into wordfence.com to change it.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>您確定要重置此網站的 Wordfence 授權嗎？ 這將停用進階功能，並將網站返回到 Wordfence "
"的免費版本。重新安裝授權時仍會保留您的設定。</p><p>"
"如果為目前授權啟用自動續訂，則授權將在下一個到期日期續訂。如果您想關閉續訂，或將授權分配給其他網站，請登入 wordfence.com 進行更改。</p>"

