"<span class=\"wf-red-dark\">Warning:</span> You are running the LiteSpeed "
"web server and Wordfence can't determine whether \"noabort\" is set. Please "
"verify that the environmental variable \"noabort\" is set for the local site,"
" or the server's global External Application Abort is set to \"No Abort\"."
msgstr ""
"<span class =“ wf-red-dark”>警告：</ span>您正在執行 LiteSpeed Web 服務器，Wordfence "
"無法確定是否設置了「noabort」。請驗證是否為本地網站設置了環境變數「noabort」，或服務器的全局「外部應用程序中止」設置為「不中止」。"

