#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3010 lib/wordfenceClass.php:3067
msgid ""
"<strong>CHECK YOUR PHONE</strong>: A code has been sent to your phone and "
"will arrive within 30 seconds. Enter it below to sign in."
msgstr "<strong>檢查您的手機</strong>：代碼已發送到您的手機，將在 30 秒內完成。並在下方輸入以登入。"

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3072
msgid ""
"<strong>CHECK YOUR PHONE</strong>: A code has been sent to your phone and "
"will arrive within 30 seconds. Please sign in again and add a space and the "
"code to the end of your password (e.g., <code>wfABCD</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>檢查您的手機</strong>：代碼已發送到您的手機，將在 30 秒內完成。請重新登入，並在密碼末端加入一個空格和代碼（例如：<code>"
"wfABCD</code>）。"

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:3015
msgid ""
"<strong>CHECK YOUR PHONE</strong>: A code has been sent to your phone and "
"will arrive within 30 seconds. Please sign in again and add a space, the "
"letters <code>wf</code>, and the code to the end of your password (e.g., "
"<code>wf123456</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>檢查您的手機</strong>：代碼已發送到您的手機，將在 30 秒內完成。請重新登入，並在密碼末端加入一個空格、字母 <code>"
"wf</code> 和代碼（例如 <code>wf123456</code>）。"

#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:2897
msgid ""
"<strong>CODE EXPIRED. CHECK YOUR PHONE:</strong> The code you entered has "
"expired. Codes are only valid for 30 minutes for security reasons. We have "
"sent you a new code. Please sign in using your username, password, and the "
"new code we sent you."
msgstr ""
"<strong>代碼已過期。檢查您的手機：</strong>您輸入的代碼已過期。基於安全考量，代碼僅在 30 "
"分鐘內有效。我們已向您發送了一個新代碼。請使用您的使用者名稱、密碼，以及我們發送給您的新代碼來登入。"

#: modules/login-security/classes/controller/wordfencels.php:689
