#: lib/menu_support.php:34
msgid ""
"As a Wordfence Care customer you are entitled to hands-on priority support "
"and have access to our incident response team. Our senior support engineers "
"and incident response team respond to requests quickly within business hours "
"(Monday to Friday, 6am to 5pm Pacific and 9am to 8pm Eastern time) and can "
"sign-in to your site on request to assist with complex issues."
msgstr ""
"作為 Wordfence Care "
"客戶，您有權獲得動手優先支援，並可以訪問我們的事件回應團隊。我們的進階支援工程師，和事件回應團隊會在工作時間（週一至週五，太平洋時間上午 6 點至下午 "
"5 點，以及東部時間上午 9 點至晚上 8 點）快速回應請求，並可能會要求登入您的網站，以協助解決複雜問題。"

#: lib/menu_support.php:36
msgid ""
"As a Wordfence Premium customer you're entitled to paid support via our "
"ticketing system. Our senior support engineers respond to Premium tickets "
"during regular business hours (Monday to Friday, 6am to 5pm Pacific and 9am "
"to 8pm Eastern time) and have a direct line to our QA and development teams."
msgstr ""
"作為 Wordfence 進階客戶，您有權透過我們的工單系統取得付費支援。我們的進階支援工程師會在正常工作時間（週一至週五，太平洋時間上午 6 點至下午 "
"5 點以及東部時間上午 9 點至晚上 8 點）回覆進階工單，並直接與我們的 QA 和開發團隊聯繫。"

#: lib/menu_support.php:32
msgid ""
"As a Wordfence Response customer you are entitled to hands-on priority "
"support 24 hours a day 365 days a year. Our incident response team is "
"available out of hours to handle urgent issues and security incidents. Our "
"customer support team is available during business hours (Monday to Friday, "
"6am to 5pm Pacific and 9am to 8pm Eastern time) for product assistance. Both "
"teams can sign-in to your site to assist, on request."
msgstr ""
"作為 Wordfence Response 客戶，您有權一年 365 天、一天 24 "
"小時獲得動手優先支援。我們的事件回應團隊可以在下班時間處理緊急問題和安全事件。我們的客戶支援團隊在工作時間（週一至週五，太平洋時間上午 6 點至下午 5 "
"點以及東部時間上午 9 點至晚上 8 點）提供產品協助。兩個團隊都可以根據要求來登入您的網站以提供協助。"

