"對於大多數網站，我們建議允許從美國訪問，Google "
"和其他良性爬蟲位於美國。一些著名的爬蟲也在歐洲有地位，所以在封鎖其他國家時要小心，特別是如果您沒有看到來自這些國家或地區的重大攻擊。"

#: modules/login-security/views/options/option-roles.php:64
msgid ""
"For roles that require 2FA, users will have this many days to set up 2FA. "
"Failure to set up 2FA during this period will result in the user losing "
"account access. This grace period will apply to new users from the time of "
"account creation. For existing users, this grace period will apply relative "
"to the time at which the requirement is implemented. This grace period will "
"not automatically apply to admins and must be manually enabled for each "
"admin user."
msgstr ""
"對於需要 2FA 的角色，用戶將有這麼多天來設定 2FA。在此期間未能設定 2FA "
"將導致使用者失去帳戶存取權限。此寬限期將從帳戶建立之日起適用於新使用者。對於現有用戶，此寬限期將相對於實施要求的時間適用。此寬限期不會自動套用於管理員，必須為每個管理員使用者手動啟用。"

#: views/scanner/scan-type.php:33
