"If enabled, XML-RPC calls that require authentication will also require a "
"valid 2FA code to be appended to the password. You must choose the "
"\"Skipped\" option if you use the WordPress app, the Jetpack plugin, or "
"other services that require XML-RPC."
msgstr ""
"如果啟用，需要身份驗證的 XML-RPC 呼叫還需要將有效的 2FA 代碼附加到密碼中。如果您使用 WordPress 應用程式、Jetpack "
"外掛程式或其他需要 XML-RPC 的服務，則必須選擇「跳過」選項。"

