"WordPress and not used with your current version. Hosting or permissions "
"issues can cause these files to get left behind when WordPress is updated "
"and they should be removed if possible."
msgstr ""
"該檔案位於 WordPress 核心位置，但來自 WordPress 的較早版本，未與目前版本一起使用。託管或權限問題可能會導致這些檔案在 "
"WordPress 更新時被拋在後面，如果可能，應將其刪除。"

#. translators: File path.
#: lib/wordfenceHash.php:626
