#: modules/login-security/views/settings/options.php:120
msgid ""
"When enabled, a Wordfence 2FA tab will be added to the WooCommerce account "
"menu which will provide access for users to manage 2FA settings outside of "
"the WordPress admin area. Testing the WooCommerce account interface after "
"enabling this feature is recommended to ensure theme compatibility."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，Wordfence 2FA 標籤將會新增至 WooCommerce 帳戶選單中，該標籤將為使用者提供在 WordPress 管理區域之外管理 "
"2FA 設定的存取權限。建議啟用此功能後測試 WooCommerce 帳戶介面，以確保主題相容性。"

#: modules/login-security/views/settings/options.php:108
msgid ""
"When enabled, reCAPTCHA and 2FA prompt support will be added to WooCommerce "
"login and registration forms in addition to the default WordPress forms. "
"Testing WooCommerce forms after enabling this feature is recommended to "
"ensure plugin compatibility."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，除了預設的 WordPress 表單之外，reCAPTCHA 和 2FA 提示支援還將新增到 WooCommerce "
"登入和註冊表單中。建議啟用此功能後測試 WooCommerce 表單，以確保外掛程式相容性。"

#: modules/login-security/views/settings/options.php:135
msgid ""
"When enabled, the \"wordfence_2fa_management\" shortcode may be used to "
"provide access for users to manage 2FA settings on custom pages."
msgstr "啟用後，「wordfence_2fa_management」短代碼可用於為使用者提供管理自訂頁面上的 2FA 設定的存取權限。"

#: modules/login-security/views/settings/options.php:148
msgid ""
"When enabled, the 2FA management interface embedded through the WooCommerce "
"integration or via a shortcode will use a vertical stacked layout as opposed "
"to horizontal columns. Adjust this setting as appropriate to match your "
"theme. This may be overridden using the \"stacked\" attribute for individual "
"shortcodes."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，透過 WooCommerce 整合或短代碼嵌入的 2FA "
"管理介面將使用垂直堆疊佈局，而不是水平列。根據您的主題調整此設定。這可以使用單一短代碼的“stacked”屬性來覆蓋。"

#: modules/login-security/views/settings/options.php:243
msgid ""
"When enabled, the last login timestamp will be displayed for each user on "
"the WP Users page. When used in conjunction with reCAPTCHA, the most recent "
"score will also be displayed for each user."
msgstr "啟用後，將在 WP 使用者頁面上顯示每個使用者的上次登入時間戳記。當與 reCAPTCHA 結合使用時，也會顯示每個使用者的最新分數。"

#. translators: Support URL.
#: views/waf/options-group-basic-firewall.php:41
#| msgid ""
#| "When you first install the Wordfence Web Application Firewall, it will be "
#| "in learning mode. This allows Wordfence to learn about your site so that "
#| "we can understand how to protect it and how to allow normal visitors "
#| "through the firewall. We recommend you let Wordfence learn for a week "
#| "before you enable the firewall. <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" "
#| "rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn More</a>"
msgid ""
"When you first install the Wordfence Web Application Firewall, it will be in "
"learning mode. This allows Wordfence to learn about your site so that we can "
"understand how to protect it and how to allow normal visitors through the "
"firewall. We recommend you let Wordfence learn for a week before you enable "
"the firewall. <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">"
"Learn More<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>"
msgstr ""
"當您第一次安裝 Wordfence Web 應用程式防火牆時，它將處於學習模式。這允許 Wordfence "
"了解您的網站，以便我們了解如何保護它，以及如何允許普通訪問者通過防火牆。我們建議您在啟用防火牆之前，讓 Wordfence 學習一周。<a "
"href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">了解詳情<span "
"class=\"screen-reader-text\">（在新頁籤中開啟）</span></a>"

