#: lib/menu_tools_twoFactor.php:283
msgid "Your site is now using the legacy two-factor authentication system."
msgstr "您的網站現在正在使用舊式的雙重驗證系統。"

#: lib/menu_tools_twoFactor.php:244
msgid ""
"Your site is now using the new login security module and two-factor "
"authentication. Before logging out, we recommend testing your login in a "
"different browser or a private/incognito window. If any plugins or your "
"theme cause conflicts with logging in, you can revert to the old 2FA method."
msgstr ""
"您的網站目前正在使用新的登入安全模組，以及雙重驗證。登出之前，建議您在其他瀏覽器，或 私密/隱身 "
"視窗中測試您的登入名稱。如果有任何外掛或主題導致與登入衝突，則可以恢復到舊的2FA方法。"

#: lib/wfScanEngine.php:2183
msgid ""
"Your site is still using this plugin, but it is not currently available on "
"wordpress.org. Plugins can be removed from wordpress.org for various reasons."
" This can include benign issues like a plugin author discontinuing "
"development or moving the plugin distribution to their own site, but some "
"might also be due to security issues. In any case, future updates may or may "
"not be available, so it is worth investigating the cause and deciding "
"whether to temporarily or permanently replace or remove the plugin."
msgstr ""
"您的網站仍在使用此插件，但目前在 wordpress.org 上不可用。由於各種原因，插件可能會從 wordpress.org "
"中刪除。這可能包括良性問題，例如插件作者停止開發或將插件分發移至自己的站點，但有些也可能是由於安全問題造成的。無論如何，未來的更新可能可用，也可能不可用，因此值得調查原因並決定是否暫時或永久替換或刪除該外掛程式。"

#. translators: 1. PHP version. 2. PHP version.
#: lib/wfVersionCheckController.php:78
msgid ""
"Your site is using a PHP version (%1$s) that is no longer supported by "
"Wordfence and needs to be updated. We recommend using the newest version of "
"PHP available but will currently support PHP versions as old as %2$s. "
"Version checks are run regularly, so if you have successfully updated, you "
"can dismiss this notice or check that the update has taken effect later."
msgstr ""
"您網站所使用的 PHP 版本（%1$s）不再受 Wordfence 支援，需要進行更新。我們建議使用最新的 PHP 版本，但目前會支援 %2$s 這樣的 "
"PHP 版本。版本檢查將會定期執行，所以如果您已經成功地進行了更新，可以不用理會此通知，或在以後檢查更新是否已經生效。"

#. translators: 1. PHP version. 2. PHP version.
#: lib/wfVersionCheckController.php:53
msgid ""
"Your site is using a PHP version (%1$s) that will no longer be supported by "
"Wordfence in an upcoming release and needs to be updated. We recommend using "
"the newest version of PHP available but will currently support PHP versions "
"as old as %2$s. Version checks are run regularly, so if you have "
"successfully updated, you can dismiss this notice or check that the update "
"has taken effect later."
msgstr ""
"您網站所使用的 PHP 版本（%1$s）在即將發佈的版本中，不再被 Wordfence 支援，需要進行更新。我們建議使用最新的 PHP "
"版本，但目前會支援 %2$s 這樣的 PHP "
"版本。版本檢查將會定期執行，所以如果您已經成功地進行了更新，可以不用理會此通知，或在以後檢查更新是否已經生效。"

#. translators: 1. WordPress version. 2. WordPress version.
#: lib/wfVersionCheckController.php:179
msgid ""
"Your site is using a WordPress version (%1$s) that is no longer supported by "
"Wordfence and needs to be updated. We recommend using the newest version of "
"WordPress but will currently support WordPress versions as old as %2$s. "
"Version checks are run regularly, so if you have successfully updated, you "
"can dismiss this notice or check that the update has taken effect later."
msgstr ""
"您網站所使用的 WordPress 版本（%1$s）不再受 Wordfence 支援，需要進行更新。我們建議使用最新的 WordPress "
"版本，但目前將支援最早的 WordPress 版本，即 "
"%2$s。版本檢查將會定期執行，所以如果您已經成功地進行了更新，您可以不理會此通知，或在以後檢查更新是否已經生效。"

#. translators: 1. WordPress version. 2. WordPress version.
#: lib/wfVersionCheckController.php:154
msgid ""
"Your site is using a WordPress version (%1$s) that will no longer be "
"supported by Wordfence in an upcoming release and needs to be updated. We "
"recommend using the newest version of WordPress but will currently support "
"WordPress versions as old as %2$s. Version checks are run regularly, so if "
"you have successfully updated, you can dismiss this notice or check that the "
