#. translators: wp_mail() return value.
#: lib/wordfenceClass.php:6445
msgid ""
"Your test email was sent to the requested email address. The result we "
"received from the WordPress wp_mail() function was: %s<br /><br />A 'True' "
"result means WordPress thinks the mail was sent without errors. A 'False' "
"result means that WordPress encountered an error sending your mail. Note "
"that it's possible to get a 'True' response with an error elsewhere in your "
"mail system that may cause emails to not be delivered."
msgstr ""
"您的測試郵件已經發送到了所要求的 Email 地址。我們從 WordPress 的 wp_mail() 函數收到的結果是：%s<br /><br />"
"一個 'True' 的結果表示 WordPress 認為郵件已經發送，沒有任何錯誤。一個 'False' 的結果表示 WordPress "
"在發送您的郵件時發生錯誤。注意，有可能在您的郵件系統的其他地方出現錯誤時，得到一個 'True' 的回應，這可能會導致郵件無法送達。"

